abstract: 'A GitHub reviewer recommendation system implementing four published algorithms (RevFinder, cHRev, TurnoverRec, and Sofia) faithful to their original papers, featuring an interactive interface, advanced evaluation metrics (Precision@K, MRR, MAP, DCG), debugging tools, and thesis-ready output formats.'
